@anon.fc1605df6ee9a11e64196356eeddd5f8.144 = private unnamed_addr constant [751 x i8] c"Path to the Python environment.\0A\0Aty uses the Python environment to resolve type information and third-party dependencies.\0A\0AIf not specified, ty will attempt to infer it from the `VIRTUAL_ENV` environment variable or discover a `.venv` directory in the project root or working directory.\0A\0AIf a path to a Python interpreter is provided, e.g., `.venv/bin/python3`, ty will attempt to find an environment two directories up from the interpreter's path, e.g., `.venv`. At this time, ty does not invoke the interpreter to determine the location of the environment. This means that ty will not resolve dynamic executables such as a shim.\0A\0Aty will search in the resolved environments's `site-packages` directories for type information and third-party imports.", align 1
